    "documentation_notes": "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n### Put all models in the models folder, organized into their respective subfolders. \n### If a required folder doesn’t exist, create it.\n\n---\n\n\n## 🟣 Load Diffusion Model\n### Download the model **flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors** ~9.1GB from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-kv-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/flux2` \n\nLearn More about this model [HERE](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-kv-fp8)\n \n---\n\n## 🟣 Load CLIP\n\n###  Download **qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors**  from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`  \n\n--- \n\n## 🟣 Load VAE\n\n### Download the **flux2-vae** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/vae`  \n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n-\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n\nA realistic studio-style portrait of a young couple, the man holding a small white and brown Jack Russell type dog in his arms, the woman holding a silver short-haired cat with green eyes, both facing the camera, calm and connected expression, natural pose, soft flattering light, dark clean background, highly detailed skin, realistic eyes, natural hair texture, very detailed dog fur and cat fur, balanced composition, professional portrait photography, shallow depth of field, photorealistic, high detail"
  },
